{
  "title": "Timer",
  "description": "Clock variant with a fixed limit. Inherits start/stop/reset/restart semantics; adds Timer.expired (true once the elapsed time reaches the limit) and remaining-time accessors. Useful for cooldowns, delays, and any timed gating logic where you want to ask \"is the duration up?\" each frame.",
